{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、メリークリスマス！！\n\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事の後に\nまひろとまあやと愛未とご飯食べたよ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったし、\n楽しかった〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/25/7640410/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなといられて幸せ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ChihaFood◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー単独公演の日の差し入れ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サダハルアオキさんのエクレール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/25/7640410/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は時間がなくて食べられなかったけど\n色合いとかとっても綺麗だったので\n写真にだけ収めました(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスカラーで\nとっても綺麗！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして美味しそう...ヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたいなぁ〜\nまた機会あるかな〜(  ˟_˟  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Last Christmas」Wham!さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切なくて寂しい歌詞だけど\n敢えてクリスマスに聞くことによって\n余計に良さが引き立つ気がします。\n中学生の頃に、英語の授業中の\nリスニングでこの曲が出てきて\n歌詞をちゃんと知った時に\nこの曲の事が更に好きになりました。\n\"Last Christmas, I gave you my heart\nBut the very next day, you gave it away\nThis year, to save me from tears\